{
  "name": "EXPRESS-Bench RE baseline (random exploration)",
  "description": "Paper's Random Exploration baseline on env_express: each step teleports to a random navigable point within 3 m of the agent (env_express__sample_waypoint mirrors main.py's get_random_navigable_point_near hop) with a uniform random yaw. No LLM in the loop. After budget truncation the verdict band answers the question from the FINAL frame only, judges with an llmCall (use a gpt-4o-mini profile - benchmark-native scoring; profiles are user-level, never baked into the JSON), and env_express__evaluate folds delta/sigma into C / C* / E_path / d_T. Paper reference: RE C 36.95 / C* 62.75 / E_path 12.06.",
  "step_budget": 50,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "env_reset",
      "type": "env_express__reset",
      "label": "EXPRESS: Reset",
      "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "seed_obs",
      "type": "env_express__observe_egocentric",
      "label": "EXPRESS: Observe (seed)",
      "position": { "x": 0, "y": 220 },
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "iter_in",
      "type": "iterIn",
      "label": "Iteration Gate",
      "position": { "x": 280, "y": 200 },
      "config": {
        "version": 3,
        "pairedWith": "iter_out",
        "initPorts": [
          {
            "name": "question",
            "wire_type": "TEXT",
            "persist": true,
            "required": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sample_waypoint",
      "type": "env_express__sample_waypoint",
      "label": "EXPRESS: Sample Waypoint",
      "position": { "x": 560, "y": 200 },
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "env_step",
      "type": "env_express__step_pose",
      "label": "EXPRESS: Step",
      "position": { "x": 840, "y": 200 },
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "loop_obs",
      "type": "env_express__observe_egocentric",
      "label": "EXPRESS: Observe (loop)",
      "position": { "x": 1120, "y": 320 },
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "iter_out",
      "type": "iterOut",
      "label": "Iteration End",
      "position": { "x": 1400, "y": 200 },
      "config": {
        "pairedWith": "iter_in",
        "ports": [
          {
            "name": "rgb",
            "wire_type": "IMAGE",
            "persist": true,
            "required": true
          },
          {
            "name": "question",
            "wire_type": "TEXT",
            "persist": true,
            "required": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "answer_llm",
      "type": "llmCall",
      "label": "LLM: Answer (final frame)",
      "position": { "x": 1680, "y": 360 },
      "config": {
        "ports": [
          {
            "name": "question",
            "wire_type": "TEXT",
            "required": true
          },
          {
            "name": "rgb",
            "wire_type": "IMAGE",
            "required": true
          }
        ],
        "template": "Answer the question about this indoor scene based on the image. Reply with one short sentence - the answer only, no preamble.\n\nQ: {question}\nA: ",
        "system_prompt": "You are an embodied question answering assistant. You answer questions about a house based on what the robot's camera observes.",
        "profile": "",
        "temperature": 1.0,
        "max_tokens": 2000,
        "mode": "single_turn"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "judge_prompt",
      "type": "env_express__judge_prompt",
      "label": "EXPRESS: Judge prompt",
      "position": { "x": 1960, "y": 360 },
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "judge_llm",
      "type": "llmCall",
      "label": "LLM: Judge (use gpt-4o-mini profile)",
      "position": { "x": 2240, "y": 360 },
      "config": {
        "ports": [
          {
            "name": "user",
            "wire_type": "TEXT",
            "required": true
          },
          {
            "name": "rgb",
            "wire_type": "IMAGE",
            "required": true
          }
        ],
        "template": "{user}",
        "system_prompt": "You are an AI assistant who will help me to evaluate the response given the question, the correct answer and the scene observed by the robot.",
        "profile": "",
        "temperature": 1.0,
        "max_tokens": 2000,
        "mode": "single_turn"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "evaluate",
      "type": "env_express__evaluate",
      "label": "EXPRESS: Evaluate",
      "position": { "x": 2520, "y": 360 },
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "obs_viewer",
      "type": "imageViewer",
      "label": "Observation",
      "position": { "x": 1400, "y": 560 },
      "config": {
        "rows": 1,
        "cols": 1,
        "ports": [
          {
            "name": "rgb",
            "wire_type": "IMAGE"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "answer_scroll",
      "type": "textScroll",
      "label": "Answer + Judge",
      "position": { "x": 2240, "y": 560 },
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "metrics_viewer",
      "type": "metrics",
      "label": "Metrics",
      "position": { "x": 2520, "y": 600 },
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "output_port__metrics",
      "type": "graphOut",
      "label": "metrics",
      "position": { "x": 2800, "y": 400 },
      "config": {
        "portName": "metrics",
        "wireType": "METRICS"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note_re",
      "type": "note",
      "label": "RE baseline graph",
      "position": { "x": 560, "y": -300 },
      "config": {
        "markdown": "**Random Exploration (paper baseline)**\n\nLoop is LLM-free: `sample_waypoint` draws a navigable point within 3 m of the agent (same `get_random_navigable_point_near` call as upstream's hop) plus a uniform random yaw, and `step_pose` teleports there, accumulating geodesic path length. The loop ends on the env's per-episode `num_step` budget.\n\n**Verdict band** (fires once, off `final_*`): answer from the FINAL frame only -> `judge_prompt` assembles the benchmark's evaluation.txt prompt -> judge llmCall returns `delta, sigma` -> `evaluate` computes C / C* / E_path / d_T.\n\n**Judge model**: gpt-4o-mini (benchmark-native). Select the profile on the judge node at run time.\n\n**Paper reference**: RE C 36.95 / C* 62.75 / E_path 12.06 (Table 2).\n\n**Episode selection** is env-panel-owned (split -> episode)."
      }
    }
  ],
